WEBVTT

01:59.600 --> 02:01.720
I really can't tell the difference
between these two threads.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.120
Neither can I.

02:04.400 --> 02:05.680
Let's compare them together.

02:08.199 --> 02:09.440
Can you see it clearly now?

02:10.320 --> 02:12.640
This strand seems a bit lighter in color.

02:12.720 --> 02:15.520
Shu brocade is woven
with countless threads,

02:15.600 --> 02:17.560
and if the color
of just one thread is off,

02:17.640 --> 02:19.480
the entire brocade
will lose its brilliance.

02:19.560 --> 02:20.840
Start by observing this bunch,

02:20.920 --> 02:22.440
then take out each thread one by one,

02:22.520 --> 02:24.720
until your eyes can adapt.

02:24.800 --> 02:27.440
When you can distinguish even two threads,

02:27.520 --> 02:31.040
you'll understand which colors
can make a world of difference

02:31.120 --> 02:32.520
and truly enhance the brocade.

02:32.600 --> 02:34.880
Isn't this what
the brocade merchants need to learn?

02:34.960 --> 02:37.200
What if we help them master this step?

02:38.160 --> 02:40.840
Our Bloom Society
now offers not just Flushed Rose,

02:40.920 --> 02:42.160
but also Shu Red Silk

02:42.240 --> 02:44.120
and specialty silk thread
from various houses.

02:44.200 --> 02:46.200
But if we want to level up,

02:46.280 --> 02:48.760
we can't just dye silk,
nor can we only sell silk.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.200
Then, what else can we sell?

02:51.280 --> 02:53.840
If buyers are willing to pay extra,

02:53.920 --> 02:56.480
we can help match silk and select colors
for their brocade designs.

02:56.560 --> 02:58.160
But the problem is,
no one's buying our silk.

02:59.440 --> 03:00.360
Why are you pulling me?

03:01.000 --> 03:01.960
She'll find out eventually.

03:04.160 --> 03:05.080
Yingying,

03:05.160 --> 03:07.480
Zhao Xiuyuan's tribute brocade arrangement

03:07.560 --> 03:09.920
is not equally distributed
like with the Yang family.

03:10.600 --> 03:13.400
He only shares it with
brocade merchants loyal to him,

03:13.480 --> 03:16.120
with that "submit and prosper,
resist and perish" attitude.

03:16.200 --> 03:18.320
So, now that people know you offended him,

03:18.400 --> 03:20.360
they don't dare
to buy silk from our Bloom Society.

03:20.960 --> 03:24.400
On top of that, many are saying
you've crossed Deputy General Niu,

03:24.480 --> 03:26.040
making them even more reluctant to come.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.520
Indeed, I've offended Niu Jin.

03:31.600 --> 03:33.840
- If you guys…
- If what?

03:33.920 --> 03:35.960
We're already in the same boat.

03:36.040 --> 03:37.280
How could we possibly disembark now?

03:37.360 --> 03:40.600
Even if I told others
I have nothing to do with Ji Yingying

03:40.680 --> 03:42.520
and we'd never interact again,
who would believe me?

03:42.600 --> 03:44.520
Exactly, no one would.

03:44.600 --> 03:46.360
And right now,
only the Yizhou brocade merchants

03:46.440 --> 03:47.440
have stopped buying our silk.

03:47.520 --> 03:50.040
At worst, we'll find buyers elsewhere.

03:50.120 --> 03:51.120
Have you heard?

03:51.200 --> 03:53.160
A merchant has arrived
in Fan City recently.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.080
He's incredibly rich.

03:54.160 --> 03:56.040
- Indeed.
- He spends a fortune on brocade.

03:56.120 --> 03:57.280
Really?

03:57.360 --> 03:58.680
And that's not all.

03:58.760 --> 04:01.520
He displays every piece of brocade
offered to him outside his mansion

04:01.600 --> 04:03.640
for public review.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.240
Mother.

04:10.840 --> 04:13.080
Mother, I'm better now.
I don't need to drink it anymore.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.600
It replenishes energy and nourishes blood.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.320
Replenishes energy and nourishes blood…

04:29.680 --> 04:31.680
Mother, it's bitter!

04:40.920 --> 04:42.480
Mother, one isn't enough.

04:45.120 --> 04:46.040
Yingying…

04:48.520 --> 04:49.440
What's wrong with your mother?

04:52.120 --> 04:53.680
I made her angry.

04:53.760 --> 04:56.680
Now she ignores me, except to make me
take medicine or eat.

04:58.280 --> 05:01.960
All mothers in this world
are all the same.

05:02.800 --> 05:03.640
Who else?

05:04.240 --> 05:05.680
- My mother!
- My mother!

05:07.920 --> 05:08.880
That makes me feel so much better.

05:11.680 --> 05:12.800
Why isn't Pin here yet?

05:15.000 --> 05:16.040
She…

05:16.640 --> 05:18.320
Her mother dragged her
to another blind date?

05:19.680 --> 05:22.080
Another blind date? No way!

05:22.160 --> 05:24.040
I'm her hero. I must save her!

05:26.600 --> 05:29.240
- I will never leave Bloom Society!
- Stop right there!

05:29.320 --> 05:31.840
Ji Yingying is nothing but trouble,
causing problems all day long!

05:31.920 --> 05:33.400
- Just look at what you've become!
- Don't hit her.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.440
Before joining Bloom Society,

05:34.520 --> 05:36.120
you've never acted so rebellious!

05:36.200 --> 05:37.960
I'm telling you, if you keep this up,

05:38.040 --> 05:39.360
you really won't be able to get married!

05:39.440 --> 05:40.480
Then so be it!

05:40.560 --> 05:41.440
- What's the big deal?
- Just stop.

05:41.520 --> 05:42.760
I…

05:42.840 --> 05:44.600
- Sir, please don't be mad…
- Don't stop me!

05:44.680 --> 05:45.720
Sir, wait!

05:45.800 --> 05:47.840
You go first! Sir, please don't be angry!

05:47.920 --> 05:50.040
Mrs., don't worry, I'll talk to her.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.800
Rest assured.

05:51.880 --> 05:54.160
Pin! Pin.

05:54.960 --> 05:56.600
Your mother forced you
into another blind date?

05:57.320 --> 06:00.120
Sang Shisi, can you just leave me alone?

06:00.200 --> 06:02.400
Pin, some men may lack taste,

06:02.480 --> 06:04.000
but that doesn't mean all men do.

06:04.080 --> 06:05.320
I happen to like you just as you are.

06:05.400 --> 06:07.000
Please, stop talking.

06:07.080 --> 06:08.160
Pin, don't worry.

06:08.240 --> 06:09.240
If your mother forces you again,

06:09.320 --> 06:10.640
just tell her I'm willing to marry you!

06:10.720 --> 06:12.600
Shut up! Who wants you to marry me?

06:12.680 --> 06:14.800
I'll never get married in this life.
I won't get married!

06:14.880 --> 06:17.160
It's fine if you don't
want to get married, but don't cry.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.320
You don't understand.
You don't know anything.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.240
Stop following me!

06:20.320 --> 06:21.160
I…

06:25.000 --> 06:26.240
I want to know.

06:26.960 --> 06:28.280
But you won't tell me anything.

06:32.800 --> 06:33.840
Yingying.

06:41.560 --> 06:44.000
Pin, why are you here?

06:44.520 --> 06:46.280
Did you argue with your mother again?

06:46.960 --> 06:49.400
I've run away from home.
I'm never going back.

06:51.080 --> 06:53.160
But I don't know where to go.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.000
Don't cry.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.280
It's fine. You can stay at my place.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.640
My mother likes you so much.

06:59.720 --> 07:01.400
She'd love for you
to live with us every day.

07:02.360 --> 07:05.000
I mean, I don't know
where I'll go in the future.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.120
I understand.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.280
Don't worry.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.320
Just keep moving forward.

07:13.400 --> 07:15.120
Maybe you'll figure it out later.

07:19.880 --> 07:21.320
I'll take you somewhere right now!

07:32.120 --> 07:32.960
Heads up.

07:35.120 --> 07:37.320
She already owes me three jars of wine!

07:37.400 --> 07:39.280
Yingying, where are we going?

07:39.960 --> 07:42.400
A strange person has come to Fan City.
Let's check him out.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.800
Fan City?

07:43.880 --> 07:46.520
My mother says Fan City is full of crooks.
They're all bad people.

07:47.520 --> 07:49.760
Your mother also says
I'm a bad person. Am I?

07:50.680 --> 07:53.640
You can't just rely on hearsay.
You need to see for yourself.

07:53.720 --> 07:56.200
Besides, we've got Yu with us,
so no worries.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.120
I hope everything goes smoothly today

08:00.200 --> 08:01.920
and we can return home before dark.

08:02.000 --> 08:04.600
Is that strange person surnamed Bai?

08:04.680 --> 08:06.280
He made a big scene,
spending money like water.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.480
So, you've heard about it too.

08:09.080 --> 08:10.800
Someone throwing money around like that…

08:10.880 --> 08:12.680
Either they've lost their mind

08:12.760 --> 08:15.080
or they have a hidden agenda.

08:16.520 --> 08:19.520
He must have a hidden agenda.

08:20.040 --> 08:22.920
He's using public evaluation
to find out the true value of Shu brocade,

08:23.720 --> 08:25.160
then buying it close to its actual price.

08:25.240 --> 08:28.480
Plus, in a short time,
he's made a name for himself.

08:29.280 --> 08:31.320
- So clever.
- So cunning.

08:31.400 --> 08:33.280
What an opportunity.

08:35.640 --> 08:39.159
All kinds of rare stones!

08:39.240 --> 08:40.600
Take a look!

08:40.679 --> 08:43.600
Hey there, my friend,
come and check out our gemstones!

08:47.120 --> 08:49.040
Most of the brocade merchants in Yizhou

08:49.120 --> 08:51.160
no longer dare to buy silk
from Bloom Society.

08:51.240 --> 08:53.000
I have no choice but to try my luck here.

08:53.920 --> 08:57.000
Since Mr. Bai spends so lavishly,

08:57.080 --> 08:58.760
he might just be bold enough
to work with us.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.600
That's like asking blood from a stone.

09:01.680 --> 09:03.440
It's better than living without hope.

09:09.160 --> 09:10.240
Beautiful!

09:17.040 --> 09:18.040
Thank you!

09:18.120 --> 09:20.760
Miss, it's five wen.

09:24.800 --> 09:27.560
Others sell five for one wen,
and you're charging one for five wen?

09:27.640 --> 09:30.040
What a deal…
Robbery with a bun as a bonus!

09:30.640 --> 09:32.400
The bun's cheap.

09:34.560 --> 09:36.160
It's the dance that's expensive.

09:36.840 --> 09:39.680
No wonder people say
Fan City folks are the best at business.

09:47.720 --> 09:49.720
Where is Mr. Bai in Fan City?

09:52.400 --> 09:53.480
Six wen.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.560
You shouldn't be so greedy.

09:56.640 --> 09:57.640
Yu.

10:16.680 --> 10:18.920
The bun is free, but flying costs six wen.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.360
So, will you pay or show us the way?

10:24.640 --> 10:27.640
What a great way to make money,
but you should know your limits,

10:27.720 --> 10:29.480
or you might anger people
and can't win them.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.960
It's not worth it.

10:35.680 --> 10:36.520
Try it.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.960
Try it. A five-wen bun…

10:41.520 --> 10:44.400
This is an authentic
Lingyanggong-pattern brocade.

10:45.000 --> 10:47.360
It's been passed down for a hundred years.

10:47.440 --> 10:48.800
If it weren't for my family needing money,

10:48.880 --> 10:51.360
I'd never sell it.

10:51.440 --> 10:54.640
Please, everyone, offer a fair price.

10:54.720 --> 10:57.000
Thank you all. Thank you all!

10:57.080 --> 10:58.680
A hundred years?

10:58.760 --> 11:00.280
How can the colors still be so vivid?

11:00.960 --> 11:02.840
This is what Shu brocade is all about.

11:02.920 --> 11:04.520
Timeless and enduring.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.600
However…

11:10.880 --> 11:13.560
GILDED WEAVE ATELIER

11:17.200 --> 11:19.240
LEE, 700 WEN

11:19.320 --> 11:20.840
WANG HUNG

11:20.920 --> 11:21.880
LEE QUANG HUNG

11:21.960 --> 11:24.400
This is what you all think

11:24.480 --> 11:27.240
this brocade is worth.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.920
Does anyone else have a different opinion?

11:35.400 --> 11:37.160
Turns out he noticed something.

11:38.160 --> 11:39.360
Noticed what?

11:41.120 --> 11:42.360
That there's something wrong
with the brocade.

11:42.880 --> 11:44.640
Anyone else want to bid?

11:47.080 --> 11:48.040
I'll bid!

12:10.920 --> 12:13.360
This miss says this brocade

12:14.160 --> 12:15.480
is worth absolutely nothing.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.760
She clearly doesn't understand!

12:21.840 --> 12:23.040
Then, tell me.

12:23.600 --> 12:26.160
Do you think this brocade is fake?

12:26.240 --> 12:27.320
Mr. Bai,

12:27.400 --> 12:29.720
don't listen to this
troublemaker's nonsense.

12:29.800 --> 12:31.000
It's obvious to everyone.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.720
This brocade is definitely not fake!

12:32.800 --> 12:35.200
Indeed, it's not fake,

12:35.280 --> 12:36.720
but it's not entirely genuine either.

12:44.080 --> 12:47.240
I may not be highly skilled,
and I am in the silk trade,

12:47.320 --> 12:49.760
but I simply can't stand
any form of deception.

12:49.840 --> 12:51.680
That's why I had to speak up.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.960
If judged on its own,

12:55.560 --> 12:57.520
this brocade is worth some money.

12:58.120 --> 13:00.640
But in business, without integrity,

13:00.720 --> 13:03.760
even the finest goods become worthless.

13:05.840 --> 13:09.200
This brocade isn't fake,
but it's not a hundred years old either.

13:09.840 --> 13:13.120
The pattern on it
uses the linked bead horse motif.

13:14.400 --> 13:15.760
So what?

13:15.840 --> 13:19.320
Lingyanggong pattern often favored
linked bead and horse motifs.

13:19.920 --> 13:22.240
But that's a recent Lingyanggong pattern.

13:22.320 --> 13:24.400
A hundred years ago,
the Lingyanggong pattern

13:24.480 --> 13:26.760
didn't favor linked bead motifs.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.440
They used Tuanke pattern instead.

13:29.080 --> 13:31.280
Even if they uses linked bead motifs,

13:31.360 --> 13:33.760
it's usually double-linked beads,
not this single-link bead style.

13:35.560 --> 13:38.920
This is a pattern from our imitation
of Persian brocade design,

13:39.000 --> 13:41.160
not the early Lingyanggong pattern.

13:41.960 --> 13:43.160
What Tuanke pattern?

13:43.240 --> 13:45.200
You dare spout nonsense
in front of Mr. Bai?

13:45.280 --> 13:46.520
You must have a death wish!

13:46.600 --> 13:47.800
How dare you act out?

13:48.680 --> 13:49.800
How dare you act out?

13:50.520 --> 13:53.200
This miss hasn't finished speaking yet.

13:53.280 --> 13:54.760
Do you plan to resort to violence?

13:56.000 --> 13:56.920
Mr. Bai…

13:57.880 --> 13:59.680
She… She's making baseless accusations,

13:59.760 --> 14:01.320
clearly slandering me!

14:02.000 --> 14:04.480
He says you lack evidence.
What do you say?

14:05.760 --> 14:07.040
Mr. Bai, please look here.

14:08.200 --> 14:10.000
The thread color used here

14:10.080 --> 14:13.160
is between water blue and pale white.

14:13.240 --> 14:16.360
It's a new color known as crust green.

14:16.440 --> 14:17.800
It was first dyed 15 years ago

14:17.880 --> 14:21.120
by Shen Yang from the Shen's Dyehouse.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.480
So, tell me.

14:22.560 --> 14:25.800
How could it possibly appear
on a brocade claimed to be ancestral?

14:26.400 --> 14:28.280
This ancestor seems far too young!

14:31.840 --> 14:33.840
Why do you get to decide its color?

14:33.920 --> 14:37.080
I say it's just water blue!

14:38.000 --> 14:39.600
It's not up to me to decide.

14:39.680 --> 14:42.200
But the Brocade Bureau
can test the silk and dye.

14:42.280 --> 14:44.440
Mr. Bai, you can take it
to the Brocade Bureau.

14:44.520 --> 14:45.520
A test will reveal the truth.

14:45.600 --> 14:46.960
I… I'm not selling it anymore!

14:49.920 --> 14:52.280
Sir, please have mercy!

14:53.800 --> 14:54.800
Sir,

14:54.880 --> 14:57.080
please have mercy! I… I won't do it again.

14:57.160 --> 14:58.480
I… I will never do it again!

14:58.560 --> 15:00.120
I spend a fortune on brocade,

15:00.200 --> 15:02.880
inviting Shu brocade experts
to witness it.

15:04.200 --> 15:05.640
Isn't that sincere enough?

15:07.400 --> 15:08.720
And yet you tried to deceive me?

15:11.680 --> 15:12.880
Take him to the authorities.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.520
Mr. Bai…

15:15.320 --> 15:16.320
Please spare me!

15:19.760 --> 15:20.640
Everyone,

15:21.440 --> 15:24.000
today's brocade appraisal is now over.

15:24.800 --> 15:27.320
Come early tomorrow. Please disperse.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.320
I am Bai Sheng.

15:37.400 --> 15:39.320
May I ask your name, Miss?

15:39.920 --> 15:41.200
I am Ji Yingying.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.640
So, you're Ms. Ji.

15:44.720 --> 15:45.760
You've heard of me?

15:46.720 --> 15:48.640
The very first day I arrived in Yizhou,

15:48.720 --> 15:50.680
I saw your phoenix soar.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.160
You have sharp eyes.

15:53.800 --> 15:55.280
I, too, am a lover of brocade,

15:55.360 --> 15:56.320
and I have a few pieces at home.

15:56.400 --> 15:58.720
I'd like you to appraise.

15:59.960 --> 16:02.040
If you find any fakes,

16:02.120 --> 16:04.840
how about three gold leaves per fake?

16:07.200 --> 16:08.840
It's almost dark.

16:11.480 --> 16:14.360
I trust you both can keep this a secret
from my mother, right?

16:23.640 --> 16:26.120
THE BAI RESIDENCE

16:26.200 --> 16:27.080
This way, please.

16:28.400 --> 16:30.680
Feel free to take a look around.

16:44.280 --> 16:46.440
This geometric brocade with sheep motifs

16:46.520 --> 16:48.080
was popular during
the Wei and Jin dynasties.

16:49.280 --> 16:50.800
It's rarely seen today.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.520
This floral Tuanke brocade with birds,

16:56.120 --> 16:57.480
though a common design,

16:57.560 --> 16:59.920
is exquisitely woven
and naturally colored,

17:00.000 --> 17:01.880
making it a rare treasure.

17:08.520 --> 17:11.640
Ms. Ji, that sigh of yours… Does it mean

17:11.720 --> 17:13.240
you think this brocade is fake?

17:13.319 --> 17:16.720
Your collection consists
only of authentic, top-grade pieces.

17:16.800 --> 17:19.480
I doubt I'll earn any gold leaves today.

17:21.200 --> 17:22.800
Ms. Ji,

17:22.880 --> 17:26.040
your righteous intervention today
saved me from being deceived.

17:26.119 --> 17:28.760
This gold leaf is rightfully yours.

17:31.760 --> 17:33.480
Even if I hadn't stepped forward,

17:33.560 --> 17:36.040
you wouldn't have fallen for the scam.

17:36.120 --> 17:38.000
You noticed the brocade had issues.

17:38.080 --> 17:39.960
Otherwise,
you wouldn't have repeatedly asked

17:40.040 --> 17:42.000
if anyone else wanted to bid.

17:43.440 --> 17:47.480
You just needed someone
to point it out clearly for you.

17:48.600 --> 17:50.360
That's why I said…

17:50.440 --> 17:52.480
Ms. Ji, you have sharp eyes.

17:54.960 --> 17:56.240
I wonder, Mr. Bai,

17:56.320 --> 17:59.040
would you use your gold leaves
to buy silk instead?

18:00.400 --> 18:02.160
Buy silk? What do you mean?

18:02.800 --> 18:04.040
Shu brocade is precious,

18:04.120 --> 18:06.040
but high-quality silk
is even harder to come by.

18:06.120 --> 18:09.400
I can dye the finest silk
in all of Yizhou.

18:11.400 --> 18:12.920
To be honest with you,

18:13.000 --> 18:14.640
I don't know how to weave brocade,

18:14.720 --> 18:16.000
nor do I know how to dye silk.

18:16.600 --> 18:20.720
These are merely interests for me,
not business ventures.

18:22.280 --> 18:24.080
Just interests?

18:25.520 --> 18:28.680
Then, in your view,

18:28.760 --> 18:30.440
what is my purpose?

18:34.760 --> 18:37.720
I thought you had a grand
business opportunity waiting for me.

18:39.520 --> 18:41.920
Looks like I'm going to disappoint you.

18:45.320 --> 18:47.400
If it's just about buying brocade,

18:47.480 --> 18:49.720
why go through all this trouble?

18:49.800 --> 18:52.080
I know exactly
whose brocade is the best in town.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.520
If you're interested,

18:53.600 --> 18:56.560
I can introduce you
to the brocade merchants.

18:57.240 --> 19:01.520
Ms. Ji, by doing this,
what do you hope to gain?

19:02.200 --> 19:04.200
- Favors.
- Favors?

19:04.280 --> 19:05.360
To be frank,

19:05.440 --> 19:06.800
due to some misunderstandings,

19:06.880 --> 19:09.600
most of the brocade merchants in town
no longer buy my silk.

19:10.200 --> 19:13.080
But if I introduce your business to them

19:13.160 --> 19:14.520
and they profit handsomely,

19:14.600 --> 19:17.000
how could they refuse to use my silk?

19:17.880 --> 19:21.320
Then, if I were to start a business,
why not deal with them directly

19:21.400 --> 19:23.040
instead of going through you?

19:24.880 --> 19:26.080
You could,

19:26.160 --> 19:30.600
but in Yizhou, do you know
each house's specialties?

19:30.680 --> 19:32.160
Their material quality?

19:32.240 --> 19:34.040
When to buy at the lowest price?

19:34.120 --> 19:37.600
Do you know which designs
are currently trending

19:37.680 --> 19:39.600
and which are outdated stock?

19:39.680 --> 19:42.880
Of course, you could hire someone
to find all this out,

19:43.680 --> 19:46.840
but why hire a stranger

19:46.920 --> 19:49.480
when you could work with someone

19:49.560 --> 19:50.680
who has no other options

19:50.760 --> 19:53.840
and seeks mutual benefit with you?

19:55.920 --> 19:59.000
I naturally trust you.

19:59.560 --> 20:00.760
However,

20:00.840 --> 20:03.280
this time, I've completed
my brocade purchase

20:03.360 --> 20:05.080
and am quite satisfied.

20:07.120 --> 20:09.400
It doesn't matter.
There's always another day.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.720
I hope there'll be opportunities
in the future

20:10.800 --> 20:11.960
to collaborate with you.

20:12.040 --> 20:12.960
Certainly.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.280
- Farewell.
- I won't see you out.

20:18.640 --> 20:21.000
Not doing business, yet gaining such fame…

20:21.080 --> 20:22.600
Either he's crazy or he's scheming.

20:26.880 --> 20:27.720
Master,

20:28.680 --> 20:32.240
we need an opportunity
to break into Yizhou's brocade industry.

20:32.320 --> 20:34.000
And now, Ji Yingying

20:34.520 --> 20:35.960
is seeking a partnership.

20:36.600 --> 20:38.080
Since you're interested in her,

20:38.880 --> 20:41.920
why not take this chance
to agree to her proposal?

20:42.000 --> 20:44.480
For now, we are just one option for her,

20:44.560 --> 20:45.800
not her only choice.

20:46.360 --> 20:48.240
When she hits rock bottom,

20:48.320 --> 20:49.840
then we can name our price.

20:50.360 --> 20:52.400
No rush. Let's wait and see.

21:18.520 --> 21:21.960
Brocade Master Zhao,
I've noted the amount of Shu Red Silk.

21:22.040 --> 21:25.320
Once the silk thread and dyes are ready,
I'll begin dyeing.

21:25.400 --> 21:27.240
I promise it won't delay
the brocade weaving.

21:28.920 --> 21:31.160
That's not why I came to see you today.

21:33.280 --> 21:34.680
Recently, there's a rumor,

21:35.400 --> 21:38.520
saying you've offended me
and the Niu family,

21:38.600 --> 21:41.640
causing brocade merchants
to avoid buying your silk.

21:44.120 --> 21:45.360
I have an idea.

21:46.440 --> 21:48.760
How about the two of us
stroll through the streets together?

21:49.680 --> 21:51.560
If people see us getting along,

21:51.640 --> 21:54.240
the rumors will fall apart on their own.

21:54.320 --> 21:55.480
Those aren't just rumors.

21:56.600 --> 21:58.320
Niu Jin did offend me.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.640
And so did you.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.400
You're holding General Niu in check,

22:06.200 --> 22:09.440
so Niu Wuniang
is trying to outdo you in business

22:09.520 --> 22:10.880
to curry favor with General Niu.

22:11.520 --> 22:13.720
That's why she spread the rumors.

22:16.120 --> 22:18.600
I'm competing with Niu Wuniang
in the Zhao family's domain,

22:19.480 --> 22:21.080
so I can't openly help you.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.640
But, Yingying,

22:22.720 --> 22:26.040
you must know I would never harm you.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.840
The Yu family has struggled for years,

22:34.520 --> 22:36.280
and they failed to secure
the tribute brocade order.

22:36.960 --> 22:39.400
So, Yu Shu wants to sell it off.

22:40.920 --> 22:42.320
Why are you telling me this?

22:44.120 --> 22:45.920
Because you once said,

22:46.000 --> 22:48.560
"The one who truly understands me
is Mr. Zhao."

22:49.760 --> 22:52.480
Even if I didn't tell you,
you would find out and take action.

22:53.000 --> 22:54.560
That place was once your home.

22:55.400 --> 22:58.680
It's filled with memories of your father.

22:59.720 --> 23:02.440
Moreover, acquiring it
would shorten your journey

23:02.520 --> 23:04.240
from silk to brocade.

23:06.480 --> 23:09.000
This is all my savings. Take it

23:11.720 --> 23:13.040
as a loan from me for now.

23:15.080 --> 23:17.160
Did you intentionally withhold
the order from the Yu family?

23:22.400 --> 23:24.280
Yang Jinglan would take risks for you,

23:25.600 --> 23:26.440
and so would I.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.480
Mr. Zhao,

23:30.360 --> 23:33.040
some things are better left in the past.

23:33.960 --> 23:35.400
If you can't let go,

23:36.120 --> 23:37.480
there's no need to do anything for me.

23:38.160 --> 23:40.080
All I hope is that you face yourself

23:40.760 --> 23:43.760
and live with a clear conscience.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.680
Tell me.

24:12.760 --> 24:14.040
If my master already knew

24:14.120 --> 24:15.680
there was something wrong
on Mount Qingcheng,

24:16.640 --> 24:18.000
why didn't he report it and request aid?

24:18.080 --> 24:19.360
Unless

24:20.760 --> 24:23.560
he was already surrounded,
isolated with no support.

24:27.480 --> 24:30.800
I thought causing a big stir here

24:30.880 --> 24:33.960
and exposing everything
would bring the culprit to justice.

24:34.040 --> 24:35.200
But who could have guessed

24:35.720 --> 24:37.920
that power could so easily
manipulate truth,

24:38.000 --> 24:39.440
turning black into white?

24:39.520 --> 24:41.720
And Niu Jin hesitates because he's afraid
someone powerful might back me.

24:41.800 --> 24:43.320
Otherwise, he wouldn't hold back.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.600
My master, back in the day,

24:46.680 --> 24:48.120
faced his challenges all alone.

24:49.000 --> 24:49.960
It must have been worse

24:51.360 --> 24:53.120
than what we face now.

24:55.600 --> 24:58.400
He knew if he died,

24:58.480 --> 25:00.480
the first one to investigate would be me.

25:01.280 --> 25:03.640
So, he left me clues.

25:03.720 --> 25:05.520
TOMB OF SHEN RUFENG

25:06.760 --> 25:09.600
He deliberately revealed his movements
to those guards

25:10.240 --> 25:13.000
to let me know there's something wrong
with this mountain.

25:17.520 --> 25:19.520
Your master was truly meticulous,

25:20.240 --> 25:21.440
planning everything thoroughly.

25:24.160 --> 25:26.360
But since he was so certain I'd return,

25:27.240 --> 25:28.760
shouldn't he have left a clue

25:29.680 --> 25:32.120
that only I could find?

25:33.520 --> 25:34.360
Kid,

25:34.440 --> 25:36.120
there are no clues

25:36.640 --> 25:39.480
because the previous two
brocade officers were clueless.

25:39.560 --> 25:40.480
When they died,

25:40.560 --> 25:42.200
they didn't think to leave
any clues either.

25:45.120 --> 25:46.600
"Even in death,
a hero's bones carry fragrance,

25:47.120 --> 25:49.440
unashamed before the world's greats."

25:50.120 --> 25:51.360
This is my master

25:52.560 --> 25:53.600
telling me

25:55.160 --> 25:56.800
that even in death,

25:56.880 --> 25:58.360
his remains can serve as evidence.

26:01.040 --> 26:02.320
Go get me a shovel.

26:04.880 --> 26:06.000
Let me just mention you…

26:07.080 --> 26:08.640
This is your master's grave.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.600
Can you really take
his offhand words seriously?

26:10.680 --> 26:12.200
I know, but I understand him.

26:13.160 --> 26:14.160
I trust him.

26:14.880 --> 26:17.400
Even if it cost his life,
he would leave me a clue.

26:47.520 --> 26:48.480
Master,

26:50.480 --> 26:51.640
your disciple has failed you,

26:53.560 --> 26:54.880
unable to uncover

26:55.680 --> 26:57.680
the Yizhou case alone.

27:00.440 --> 27:01.680
I beg you,

27:03.840 --> 27:05.400
guide me one more time.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.480
Not bad skills, huh?

27:17.000 --> 27:18.960
Just look at who your master is.

27:19.040 --> 27:20.600
- Old man.
- Call me Master.

27:25.240 --> 27:26.640
Zhuge, come over here.

27:36.240 --> 27:38.400
Every one of my master's bones is injured,

27:38.480 --> 27:39.880
except this one.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.800
The marks on it are different.

27:43.360 --> 27:44.640
Judging by the traces,

27:46.200 --> 27:47.520
this was definitely
not caused by an outsider.

27:49.080 --> 27:50.000
Then this is…

27:53.760 --> 27:54.840
This is…

27:57.320 --> 27:58.760
his final message to me.

28:04.080 --> 28:06.520
No information could get out,

28:07.840 --> 28:09.560
and no one could be trusted.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.400
He had no choice

28:15.520 --> 28:16.680
but to use his blade as a pen

28:17.440 --> 28:18.800
and his bones as paper

28:21.720 --> 28:23.040
to leave me a clue.

28:36.680 --> 28:37.680
Old man,

28:41.200 --> 28:42.440
I got your message.

28:44.120 --> 28:45.360
I swear,

28:47.680 --> 28:49.280
I will

28:50.360 --> 28:52.240
hunt down the ones who harmed you

28:53.640 --> 28:55.000
and bring them to you,

28:56.480 --> 28:57.960
to kneel before you.

29:18.360 --> 29:21.760
THE YU RESIDENCE

29:22.480 --> 29:23.600
Ms. Ji, this way, please.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.600
The head of the household
is meeting a guest.

29:25.680 --> 29:27.600
Please wait a moment.

29:29.680 --> 29:31.640
No problem, we're all part
of the Shu brocade family.

29:31.720 --> 29:32.720
Let's chat together.

29:33.720 --> 29:34.840
That voice sounds familiar.

29:34.920 --> 29:37.280
I didn't expect it
to really be you, Ms. Ji.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.440
Mr. Bai, why are you here?

29:42.240 --> 29:43.440
The Yu family's
century-old brocade business

29:43.520 --> 29:45.320
naturally has some treasures
worth acquiring.

29:46.240 --> 29:48.600
I'm here today to buy
the Yu family's brocade workshop.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.760
Just yesterday, you told me

29:51.840 --> 29:54.040
you neither understand brocade
nor do business.

29:55.440 --> 29:57.960
After hearing your words yesterday,
I was quite inspired.

29:58.040 --> 30:00.000
I thought, why not give it a try?

30:00.080 --> 30:02.040
Especially with such a great opportunity.

30:03.840 --> 30:05.880
Your bold moves are remarkable.

30:06.400 --> 30:09.040
Just a passing thought,
and you aim to swallow up

30:09.120 --> 30:10.960
one of Yizhou's three
major brocade merchants.

30:11.040 --> 30:12.760
I believe

30:13.360 --> 30:16.360
that if you're going to do business,
you might as well go big.

30:17.280 --> 30:18.520
Ms. Ji has arrived?

30:19.160 --> 30:20.920
Then, please, step inside.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.400
This way, please.

30:30.880 --> 30:31.840
Greetings, Mr. Yu.

30:33.400 --> 30:34.240
Greetings, Mrs. Yang.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.880
Ms. Ji,

30:36.960 --> 30:39.560
as for the balance
for the silk thread purchased last time,

30:39.640 --> 30:41.720
I've had it prepared.

30:41.800 --> 30:43.000
You can verify

30:43.080 --> 30:46.600
and collect it
at the accounts room shortly.

30:46.680 --> 30:51.240
As for your proposal
to collaborate with this workshop,

30:51.320 --> 30:54.760
letting Bloom Society assist
in silk selection and matching,

30:55.320 --> 30:56.600
whether to agree

30:58.720 --> 31:01.880
depends on the new manager.

31:01.960 --> 31:04.000
Has the new manager been decided?

31:04.080 --> 31:05.400
Not yet.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.600
But you can listen first

31:07.680 --> 31:11.200
to see what conditions might satisfy you.

31:12.440 --> 31:14.440
What prices have the two of you offered?

31:18.640 --> 31:22.080
Around 30% above market rate.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.240
Mr. Yu,

31:25.320 --> 31:29.000
while the Yang family's offer
doesn't match Mr. Bai's high price,

31:29.080 --> 31:31.680
our family has a long history
in brocade weaving.

31:32.480 --> 31:35.040
If the workshop is entrusted to us,

31:35.120 --> 31:36.880
it will certainly thrive for generations,

31:36.960 --> 31:39.760
without ruining its name
or mistreating your craftsmen.

31:42.800 --> 31:43.800
Ms. Ji,

31:44.840 --> 31:48.160
between the two of us,
who do you find more appealing?

31:51.760 --> 31:53.600
You offer a high price

31:53.680 --> 31:55.680
while Mrs. Yang values sentiment.

31:55.760 --> 31:57.520
Both are quite sincere.

31:58.080 --> 31:59.480
But in my view,

31:59.560 --> 32:02.680
neither offer is compelling enough.

32:04.320 --> 32:05.600
The Yu family has a century-old legacy.

32:05.680 --> 32:07.640
If we alter it so drastically,

32:07.720 --> 32:09.200
isn't it a pity?

32:10.160 --> 32:11.480
Mr. Yu has worked tirelessly all his life,

32:11.560 --> 32:13.720
bringing glory to the Yu family's brocade.

32:14.520 --> 32:15.960
Such dedication and achievements

32:16.920 --> 32:18.080
cannot be measured by any price.

32:19.080 --> 32:20.480
The business world has its highs and lows.

32:20.560 --> 32:22.440
Where there is glory,
there is also decline.

32:24.000 --> 32:25.640
If I'm not mistaken,

32:26.360 --> 32:27.240
this place

32:28.080 --> 32:29.520
was once the Ji family's old home.

32:30.120 --> 32:33.320
The Ji family's brocade
was once so illustrious,

32:33.400 --> 32:34.440
but now?

32:36.600 --> 32:37.800
I don't need to say more, do I?

32:41.680 --> 32:43.880
Mr. Yu, I'm here today

32:43.960 --> 32:46.600
to discuss this very business deal.

32:47.560 --> 32:50.520
Bloom Society is willing
to invest in the Yu family,

32:51.280 --> 32:54.200
providing silk while
the Yu family weaves brocade.

32:54.280 --> 32:56.320
This partnership would solve
your current difficulties

32:56.400 --> 32:58.120
and preserve the Yu family's brand.

32:58.200 --> 33:00.000
Wouldn't that be the best of both worlds?

33:00.080 --> 33:01.160
Ms. Ji, are you aware

33:01.240 --> 33:04.240
how much this "best of both worlds"
you speak of would cost?

33:04.320 --> 33:06.360
Yesterday, you said
you were in a difficult position.

33:06.440 --> 33:09.080
How is it that today you can
suddenly produce the money?

33:09.680 --> 33:13.200
Yesterday, I said that
because I thought we could collaborate.

33:13.960 --> 33:17.040
I didn't expect we'd become rivals today.

33:17.640 --> 33:20.800
If I successfully acquire
the Yu family's brocade workshop,

33:20.880 --> 33:23.320
I will definitely cooperate with you
to purchase silk.

33:25.480 --> 33:28.320
Mr. Yu, you know
I never make empty promises.

33:28.920 --> 33:30.880
The financial issues will be resolved,

33:30.960 --> 33:34.200
but I ask you to give me a chance.

33:39.760 --> 33:40.960
Let me think it over

33:42.960 --> 33:45.040
for another two days.

33:57.400 --> 33:59.760
Mr. Yu, if you have any concerns,

33:59.840 --> 34:00.920
feel free to speak openly.

34:10.520 --> 34:12.239
Mrs. Niu…

34:21.360 --> 34:23.960
I've heard Mr. Yu intends
to sell the brocade workshop.

34:25.239 --> 34:28.760
Is there a safer choice
than selling it to the Brocade Master?

34:34.239 --> 34:36.920
There's no rush for a reply, Mr. Yu.

34:37.000 --> 34:40.560
Today, I mainly came by
to deliver someone along the way.

34:43.159 --> 34:44.280
Grandfather!

34:47.560 --> 34:48.800
Xi!

34:51.520 --> 34:53.760
Xi, why are you in the carriage?

34:53.840 --> 34:56.679
I happened to meet her on the road.

34:57.680 --> 35:00.400
I heard that Ms. Yu has a childlike heart

35:00.480 --> 35:01.840
and lacks worldly experience.

35:02.640 --> 35:05.680
Mr. Yu, you must take
good care of your granddaughter.

35:06.600 --> 35:10.000
Next time, she might not be so lucky.

35:15.800 --> 35:17.360
Thank you, Mrs. Niu,

35:18.640 --> 35:20.440
for bringing Xi back to me.

35:24.640 --> 35:27.600
I'll wait for you at the Zhao residence.

35:44.680 --> 35:45.760
Xi,

35:47.320 --> 35:48.680
are you hurt in any way?

35:49.600 --> 35:51.200
Grandfather, I'm fine.

35:51.280 --> 35:54.520
The masked lady wasn't trying to harm me.

35:58.640 --> 35:59.880
Mr. Yu.

36:04.240 --> 36:05.360
Ms. Ji,

36:06.640 --> 36:11.840
without my company,
Xi would never go out alone.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.880
Let me be honest with you.

36:14.400 --> 36:16.760
I can do without the brocade workshop,

36:16.840 --> 36:19.920
but… I will never allow any harm

36:20.720 --> 36:22.440
to come to my Xi.

36:42.600 --> 36:44.160
When power meddles

36:45.160 --> 36:46.120
in business,

36:47.000 --> 36:48.560
it ceases to be just business.

36:55.840 --> 36:56.840
Mr. Yang,

36:57.960 --> 37:00.640
I hope you'll cut
through these villains sooner.

37:08.720 --> 37:12.400
BROCADE BUREAU

37:16.640 --> 37:18.720
Zhuge, take a look.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.880
Does this seem familiar to you?

37:23.760 --> 37:24.640
Spin them.

37:27.840 --> 37:29.600
This pattern looks like the one

37:30.320 --> 37:32.280
on the back
of a logistics officer's order.

37:34.200 --> 37:35.040
Are you sure?

37:35.120 --> 37:36.440
We agreed

37:36.520 --> 37:37.600
action is your part, and writing is mine.

37:37.680 --> 37:40.040
Before coming here,
I specifically reviewed all reports

37:40.120 --> 37:41.080
and official documents about Shu brocade.

37:45.880 --> 37:46.840
Logistics officer?

37:47.440 --> 37:48.640
Shu region's logistics officers

37:48.720 --> 37:50.960
are always appointed
by the military commissioner.

37:51.040 --> 37:54.280
And every year,
a different person is assigned.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.120
Then, we'll meet them all.

37:58.200 --> 37:59.920
You're planning to meet
the military commissioner?

38:04.320 --> 38:05.440
Even though Niu Jin
and the military commissioner

38:05.520 --> 38:06.800
are stationed in different locations,

38:06.880 --> 38:08.720
if you meet the military commissioner,

38:08.800 --> 38:10.040
Niu Jin will likely find out.

38:10.120 --> 38:11.840
Killers aren't afraid,

38:12.680 --> 38:14.000
but saviors have to hide.

38:14.520 --> 38:15.920
This world isn't right.

38:16.000 --> 38:17.320
I'm going to change it.

38:17.400 --> 38:20.240
Should we inform Ms. Ji about this?

38:21.560 --> 38:22.400
No need.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.960
Capturing the culprit
and revealing the truth

38:25.040 --> 38:26.120
is our responsibility.

38:26.720 --> 38:28.360
She's just an ordinary person.

38:28.440 --> 38:30.640
She should happily run her business

38:30.720 --> 38:33.280
and live her life in peace.

38:34.400 --> 38:35.320
All right.

38:51.040 --> 38:52.840
THE YU RESIDENCE

38:52.920 --> 38:53.880
Yingying,

38:53.960 --> 38:55.680
should we just knock on the door?

38:56.440 --> 38:58.400
This isn't the first time
you've met Mr. Yu.

38:58.480 --> 39:00.880
When he says no visitors,
he means no visitors.

39:01.520 --> 39:02.520
If he's refusing visitors,

39:02.600 --> 39:04.000
does that mean the brocade workshop
is no longer for sale?

39:04.840 --> 39:07.360
If someone wants to sell
their brocade workshop,

39:07.440 --> 39:09.000
what do they want most?

39:10.920 --> 39:12.400
If he wants money,

39:12.480 --> 39:14.600
Mr. Bai is willing to spend extravagantly.

39:15.400 --> 39:18.760
If he wants support
for Yu family craftsmen and techniques,

39:18.840 --> 39:20.720
the Yang family is the best choice.

39:21.680 --> 39:23.560
If he wants to preserve
the Yu family's legacy

39:23.640 --> 39:25.080
and get through this crisis,

39:25.160 --> 39:26.640
then he should choose me.

39:27.320 --> 39:28.800
But he hasn't chosen anyone.

39:28.880 --> 39:31.080
Could it be that Niu Wuniang
has threatened him?

39:32.960 --> 39:34.920
He's not the type to hesitate.

39:35.520 --> 39:37.960
Besides, if he had truly caved
to Niu Wuniang's threats,

39:38.040 --> 39:40.040
his workshop would already belong
to the Zhao family.

39:47.400 --> 39:49.240
Now that he's shut himself away,

39:49.320 --> 39:51.240
he must be conflicted.

39:51.320 --> 39:54.200
He's unsure whether
he should sell the workshop.

39:54.280 --> 39:56.680
This also shows that none of our offers

39:56.760 --> 39:58.000
are what he truly wants.

39:58.080 --> 39:59.560
Then what does he want?

40:01.200 --> 40:02.480
That's why I'm here.

40:03.480 --> 40:04.880
Let me tell you, in the Yu family,

40:04.960 --> 40:06.320
there's one person who understands Yu Shu

40:06.400 --> 40:07.680
even better than Yu Shu himself.

40:11.680 --> 40:12.800
You lost again.

40:14.960 --> 40:16.800
Chickens lay eggs,

40:16.880 --> 40:18.480
and eggs hatch chickens.

40:19.160 --> 40:21.960
So, tell me, which came first,
the chicken or the egg?

40:22.840 --> 40:23.760
I…

40:26.360 --> 40:27.200
I wouldn't know.

40:28.040 --> 40:30.720
You figured out Mr. Yu so quickly.

40:30.800 --> 40:31.800
You really can't be underestimated.

40:31.880 --> 40:34.560
If pigs have another life
and become human,

40:35.160 --> 40:37.640
then, is this person a human or a pig?

40:37.720 --> 40:40.400
What on earth is going on
in your head every day?

40:40.480 --> 40:43.520
They all say I'm silly,
but I think you're even sillier than I am.

40:43.600 --> 40:44.480
You…

40:46.040 --> 40:48.080
- Ms. Ji.
- Ms. Yu.

40:48.720 --> 40:49.880
Oh, Mr. Bai, you're here too.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.440
Ms. Ji, what brings you here?

40:54.520 --> 40:57.080
Whatever brought Mr. Bai
is what brought me.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.800
What's this? Losing to Ms. Yu?

41:02.520 --> 41:05.800
As you can see, a complete loss.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.360
Ms. Yu, you're quite impressive.

41:09.200 --> 41:10.240
Is your grandfather at home?

41:11.400 --> 41:13.240
My grandfather is preparing
for a trip in a few days.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.440
He's packing his things.

41:14.520 --> 41:17.120
A trip? Where's he going?

41:18.440 --> 41:19.560
You have to do the same as Mr. Bai.

41:19.640 --> 41:20.840
Win me first, then I'll tell you.

41:24.360 --> 41:27.120
REFINED AND ELEGANT, EXPRESSING SENTIMENTS

41:29.440 --> 41:30.440
You're really good!

41:30.520 --> 41:33.160
I'm still one step behind.
You're seven steps behind.

41:33.240 --> 41:35.320
If you land more than seven, you win.

41:48.960 --> 41:51.120
Exactly seven steps. You win!

41:53.080 --> 41:55.000
This round doesn't count. I lost.

41:55.560 --> 41:58.080
That wasn't a five just now.
It was a four.

42:01.480 --> 42:04.000
Then, why did it change on its own?

42:04.080 --> 42:06.560
When I do business,
I stick to my principles.

42:07.080 --> 42:08.480
If people treat me sincerely,

42:09.000 --> 42:10.080
I'll return the sincerity.

42:11.640 --> 42:12.960
It's just a game.

42:14.200 --> 42:15.120
Ms. Ji,

42:15.880 --> 42:17.760
you haven't forgotten
why you came here, right?

42:19.960 --> 42:20.960
Want to play another round?

42:21.040 --> 42:22.120
No need.

42:22.200 --> 42:23.280
Ask me whatever you want.

42:23.360 --> 42:24.440
I'll tell you everything.

42:26.040 --> 42:27.600
If people treat me sincerely,

42:27.680 --> 42:29.320
I'll return the sincerity.

42:29.400 --> 42:30.240
You said it.

42:32.600 --> 42:34.800
All right, tell me.

42:34.880 --> 42:37.360
If your grandfather
isn't preparing to sell the workshop,

42:37.440 --> 42:38.440
what's he planning to do?

42:39.680 --> 42:41.440
You all want the workshop,

42:42.200 --> 42:44.960
but my grandfather wants this.
